'''Neko-Musume''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 8.5 Update|Version 8.5]] and can be dropped from any stage in [[Yuru-i GeGeGe no Kitarou: Youkai Dotabata Daisensou Collaboration Event#Yuru-i! Neko-Musume Attacks!|Yuru-i! Neko-Musume Attacks!]] during the [[Yuru-i GeGeGe no Kitarou: Youkai Dotabata Daisensou Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 480
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Neko-Musume
|name2 = Cat Neko-Musume
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Cat Neko-Musume''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
With an outstandingly long recharge time and range that hardly outranges anything, Neko-Musume is a complete mess of a unit. None of her stats stand out to give her an actual role, and if they did, her cooldown virtually shuts down any idea of using her. [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] is superior to her by all means outside of speed due to generally higher stats and a more tolerable cooldown.

